	`- 渠道手续费（费率 ${feeBps} bps，成功支付逐笔四舍五入）：${money(report.totals.feeCents)}`,
	`- 预计到账（净收款减手续费）：${money(report.totals.settlementCents)}`,
	`- 尚未收齐：${money(report.totals.outstandingCents)}；多付款：${money(report.totals.overpaidCents)}`,
	"", "## 运营处理", "",
	...(outstanding.length ? outstanding.map((row) => `- 催款：${row.id} 尚欠 ${money(row.outstandingCents)}`) : ["- 无需催款的订单"]),
	...(overpaid.length ? overpaid.map((row) => `- 处理多付款：${row.id} 多付 ${money(row.overpaidCents)}`) : ["- 无多付款订单"]),
	...(refunded.length ? refunded.map((row) => `- 已退款（与欠款分列）：${row.id} 成功退款 ${money(row.refundCents)}`) : ["- 无成功退款订单"]),
	"", "## 人工核查", "",
	...(report.issues.length ? report.issues.map((issue) => `- ${issue.eventId} / ${issue.orderId}：${issueText[issue.code]}`) : ["- 无"]),
	"", "## 已执行检查", "",
	`- 按 Asia/Shanghai 筛选订单，按 occurredAt 判断当日 23:59:59.999 截止；截止后忽略 ${report.ignored.afterCutoff} 条，receivedAt 不用于日期归属。`,
	`- 先按 eventId 检查冲突；矛盾组全部隔离。完全相同通知去重，重复忽略 ${report.ignored.duplicates} 条，receivedAt 不参与版本比较。`,
